abstract: >-
  Open research data for a study testing whether Claude Opus 4.6 can
  close-read poetry. 10 poems, 3 prompts each, 30 responses coded
  against an 11-category framework. Includes all poems, prompts,
  verbatim outputs, coding, and process documentation.
